    "## ✅ Use Case 3: Quality Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "Automated validation of enhancement effectiveness and Phase 5D2 completion criteria."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
